      "writtenOn": "2018-08-23T17:19:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are open bugs about cr50 detecting ccd while voltages are settling. I think the hardware people are looking into leakages, but this invalid connect could also be causing the issue. \n\nCr50 should not be enabling ccd when a valid rdd connect signal hasn\u0027t been seen. This is a cr50 issue.",
